# The site image's build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT (Dockerfile, 2026-09-04),
# so this is what keeps that context small. node_modules is reinstalled from
# the lockfiles inside the image; dist/ and routeTree.gen.ts are produced per
# build; the rest is nothing the image copies.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
builder/lovable/template/src/routeTree.gen.ts
builder/GENERATOR.md
docs
public
test
scripts
supabase
*.log
